WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Brother Yuan

2
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:07,910
what did you just say

3
00:00:07,910 --> 00:00:09,430
Let me compensate you

4
00:00:11,430 --> 00:00:14,150
This is what you said about having only one second-level S-level weirdo

5
00:00:14,150 --> 00:00:16,350
Are you trying to frame my master?

6
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:18,310
The last time I came here, there was only one.

7
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:19,830
Waste stuff

8
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:24,420
Fortunately, I asked for the Tomb Emperor in advance, otherwise

9
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,900
I'm afraid I'm going to really fall into trouble here today.

10
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,620
Procrastinate for some time

11
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:33,280
Tomb Emperor Zun arrived immediately and the little brother misunderstood

12
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,240
This is the flood that washed away the Dragon King Temple.

13
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:36,320
It's all misunderstanding

14
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,940
Is it really a misunderstanding?

15
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,060
Your Zhengzhou Rail Bureau

16
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,940
Make trouble for me again and again

17
00:00:41,940 --> 00:00:44,160
I have to teach you a lesson

18
00:00:44,160 --> 00:00:45,970
little brother

19
00:00:45,970 --> 00:00:48,610
This time it's ours, I won't tell you

20
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:50,290
How do you want us to compensate you?

21
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:52,410
We, the Zhengzhou Rail Bureau, have nothing to say
